We now shift our discussion to $(t,r)$ broadcast domination on the infinite grid graph, denoted by $\mathbb{Z}\times\mathbb{Z}$. In previous literature, Blessing et al.\ and  Harris et al.\ discuss efficient domination of the infinite Cartesian and triangular lattices, respectively \cite{blessing2014tr,harris2018broadcast}. 
